      "content": "i did try talking to them but they just brushed me off and said it was just \"standard organic nutrients\" and nothing to worry about. but it doesn't feel standard. the smell is so thick it's almost oily, and it's definitely why i've been feeling so off lately. if they aren't going to change it, i need to protect my indoor air. what kind of high-grade air filtration or chemical neutralizers can i get to specifically target these kinds of organic aerosols/particulates?",
